Package: combatrefql
Title: ComBat-refQL QL-First Reference-Batch RNA-Seq Correction
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaoyu", "Zhang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "thomasirchi@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Corrects raw RNA-seq counts toward one reference batch using
    robust edgeR version 4 quasi-likelihood fitted counterfactual means and
    deterministic negative-binomial mid-P quantile transport. The package
    keeps negative-binomial and quasi-likelihood dispersion quantities
    separate and returns validated S7 objects with tidy diagnostics.
